{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "current" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Play flip board game with Personas and people nearby.\n\n- Simple design.\n\n- Support Spatial SharePlay.\n\n- Support SharePlay with people nearby.\n\n\nNotice\n\n- To use SharePlay with Personas, a FaceTime call is required.\n\n- You must set up your persona on the OS beforehand.\n\n- The persona appears as part of FaceTime."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「ペルソナ」や「近くの人」とフリップゲームを遊ぼう。\n\n・シンプルなデザインのボードゲーム。\n\n・空間SharePlayに対応しています。\n\n・近くの人とのSharePlayにも対応しています。\n\n\n「注意」\n\n・ペルソナでSharePlayをするにはFaceTimeで通話する必要があります。\n\n・OS側で先にペルソナを設定する必要があります。\n\n・ペルソナはFaceTime/SharePlayの一部として表示されます。\n\n\n==== English ====\nPlay flip board game with Personas and people nearby.\n\n- Simple design.\n\n- Support Spatial SharePlay.\n\n- Support SharePlay with people nearby.\n\n\nNotice\n\n- To use SharePlay with Personas, a FaceTime call is required.\n\n- You must set up your persona on the OS beforehand.\n\n- The persona appears as part of FaceTime."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}